'''Vanessa''' is a shop [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Birch Park}}. She will make it rain for {{c|5,000}} a minute. 

== Mechanics ==
'''Vanessa''' can be paid {{C|5,000}} to make the it rain in the {{zone|Birch Park}} for {{Green|60s}}, with the limit of {{Green|30m}}.

While raining, players gain {{Stat|fs|+25}}. Additionally, every {{Green|11}} seconds there's a {{Chance|66.6%|2|3|rolls}} chance to spawn {{Green|1-2}} {{MobSprite|Squid}}s in water if there's less than {{Green|5}} {{MobSprite|Squid}}s alive.

